      "value": "Unable to reproduce by following these steps:\n1. Log into VRChat, enter the VRChat Home \n2. Walk in front of mirror\n3. Swap from current avatar to local test avatar\n4. Wait for load\n5. Swap from local test avatar to a normal avatar\n6. Wait for load\nNo crash was observed. Can you provide more detail?",
