      "value": "@{5acad9ecc9dba010c9c3ec68|full_name}: \nOkay, I found some more things out through more testing. It appears that I only crash when I switch from the uploaded version of the avatar to the local test version and then back to the uploaded one. (All have the same ID attached and use the same model)\nSo:\n1. Log in to VRChat, join the home world.\n2. Switched to uploaded avatar that I also have a local test from. \n3. Switched to local test avatar.\n4. Switched back to uploaded avatar.\n5. Game crashes as soon as the model is loaded.",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
