      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "@{5acad9ecc9dba010c9c3ec68|full_name}: \nSo, I did even more testing and concluded, if the uploaded version gets loaded at any point and you switch to the local test version and directly back to the uploaded one, the game crashes. \nSome other information to it:\nYou do not need to directly switch from the uploaded version to the local test version it will also happen if you use any other avatar in between. Also switching from the local test version to another avatar that is not the uploaded version will not cause the game to crash. You can even switch to the uploaded version again if you loaded any other avatar in between without crashing. Also switching worlds or rejoining the current one will reset it, so it needs to be loaded again etc.\nBtw my upload avatar and the local test build are the exact same avatar, but my friend also got that issue and he just changed out the textures on the local version otherwise they are also the same.\nI hope this somehow helps, if you don't understand what I mean with something in this text just ask me please. ^^",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
