      "sourceLink": null,
      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "# Small Update to my post:\nI’ve been playing around with it more and more, and it seems like the game just has an issue with you loading the Avatar you were in before you used the Local Test Avatar. So the Local Test Avatar and the one you used before and after don’t need to have anything in common. You just need to go from your normal Avatar in to a Local Test Avatar and then back in to the Avatar you used before.\n# Repro Steps:\n1. Use any normal Uploaded Avatar (remember which one you selected)\n2. Switch into any Local Test Avatar.\n3. Switch back to that normal Uploaded Avatar (the one you used before going into the Test Avatar)\n- If you do this your game will crash.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    },
