      "sourceLink": null,
      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "I had this exact issue multiple times.\nHappens about every 2nd time I switch from a test avatar to a normal avatar.\nIt possibly has something to do with creating a new test avatar with the same name and then switch out of the test avatar after it was created.\nI have to further investigate.\nFor me, it is very annoying when work on my avatar.\nBut looking at the upvotes, it looks like it is a rare issue.",
