      "sourceLink": null,
      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "I can reproduce this crash 100 % of the time with these steps:\n1. Make sure you have the same avatar both as an uploaded avatar and as a local test avatar.\n2. Make sure you are wearing this uploaded avatar. Close the game.\n3. Start the game. Game loads with you wearing the uploaded avatar.\n4. Open the \"avatar details\" of the local test avatar.\n5. Change into the local test avatar from avatar details.\n6. Open the \"avatar details\" of the uploaded avatar.\n7. Change into the uploaded avatar from avatar details. Game crashes.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
